# Cloudflare Workers static assets: everything in dist/ is uploaded and served
# publicly, but dist/ also contains the server build. Without this file wrangler
# refuses to deploy rather than expose server-side code on the open internet:
#
#   ✘ [ERROR] Uploading a Pages _worker.js directory as an asset.
#
# Astro copies public/ into dist/ verbatim, so this lands at the root of the
# asset directory where wrangler looks for it.
#
# _worker.js   the compiled server, reachable via `main` in wrangler.jsonc
# _routes.json a Pages-only routing manifest, unused on Workers
_worker.js
_routes.json
